      "license": "MIT",
      "notes": [
        "SectionFrame alone widens its ground with transparent (no surface, inherited ink); block grounds stay the closed SectionGround. Wash reads tokens.gradient.wash; texture reads assets.pattern. Fluid heading properties are scoped to the section; global token defaults remain fixed. Reveal is opt-in and uses the shared reduced-motion policy. Rhythm is fixed in source, with no specified contract member values.",
